<title>USA: Astrologer Jeanne Dixon dies of heart attack.</title>
<headline>Astrologer Jeanne Dixon dies of heart attack.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Noted astrologer Jeanne Dixon died of a heart attack at Sibley Hospital in northwest Washington on Saturday afternoon, a spokeswoman for the hospital said.</p>
<p>Nursing coordinator Joan Vincent said Dixon died shortly after her arrival at the hospital. She was unable to give Dixon's age.</p>
